id: tornado-chaser
name: Tornado Chaser
advancement: true
prerequisite: Spin to Win
tpCost: 4
tornadoChaser: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spinning begun: the Movement out of sequence.
text: >
  Tornado Chaser: When you start spinning, you dart in the direction of your opponent.
  –Prerequisites: Spin to Win
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: Once you begin Spinning, you may use the Movement Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
